==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Hannya]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though a [[Hannya]] variant is in this stage, it should be decently easy regardless. You can just spam [[Courier Cat]] with research combos. Other anti-red or anti-Dark cats such as [[Can Can Cat|Can Can]] or [[Pizza Cat]] can also work, though anti-Red holds more merit due to [[Commander Hannya|Cmdr. Hannya]] being the only Dark enemy.

